{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18824","headline":"詶湖州崔郎中见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶湖州崔郎中见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风筝吟秋空，不肖指爪声。\n高人灵府间，律吕伴咸英。\n昔年与兄游，文似马长卿。\n今来寄新诗，乃类陶渊明。\n磨砻老益智，吟咏闲弥精。\n岂非山水乡，荡漾神机清。\n渚烟蕙兰动，溪雨虹蜺生。\n冯君虚上舍，待余乘兴行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}